Stella-
I don't know Chen's paper. Our definitions come from an earlier statistics
literature. I suggest consulting one of our papers, available here
http://imai.princeton.edu/projects/mechanisms.html , where we define the
ADE (e.g., the Psychological Methods paper), or the Stata Journal paper
Raymond and I wrote for the medeff command.

There are no general rules regarding effect sizes. That is question and
discipline specific, just like with normal regression methods. Sorry I
can't be of more guidance on that.

best,
Dustin

